{"vid":"qGmwH6DyUjo","source":"qGmwH6DyUjo.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"ARTHUR C. BROOKS: In my work, I specialize in strivers, really"},{"t":3.5,"txt":"hard-working people, ambitious people."},{"t":5.6,"txt":"These are the people who want to do a lot with their lives."},{"t":8,"txt":"They want to take a bite out of life."},{"t":9.6,"txt":"I mean, I worked with musicians that are barely getting by,"},{"t":12.2,"txt":"but they really have this sense of calling."},{"t":14.3,"txt":"I've worked with business people who are doing really well,"},{"t":16.4,"txt":"even though they're not really satisfied with what they're"},{"t":18.4,"txt":"doing."},{"t":19.2,"txt":"What all strivers I've ever met have in common"},{"t":21.2,"txt":"is that the higher they climb, and the more success that they"},{"t":23.8,"txt":"have, the more insecure they feel in their own success"},{"t":27.4,"txt":"because they're not quite sure that they've earned it"},{"t":29.6,"txt":"or deserve it."},{"t":30.6,"txt":"That's called imposter syndrome, of course."},{"t":34.3,"txt":"It's completely natural."},{"t":36.5,"txt":"It only really doesn't happen to one group"},{"t":39.3,"txt":"that I found, the people who really are imposters."},{"t":41.9,"txt":"It's one of the great ironies I found"},{"t":43.5,"txt":"is that people who deserve success through hard work"},{"t":47,"txt":"and merit and personal responsibility"},{"t":48.5,"txt":"are not quite sure they deserve it."},{"t":50.1,"txt":"And the people who don't deserve it"},{"t":51.4,"txt":"are often the people who actually"},{"t":52.5,"txt":"are most sure that they do."},{"t":53.8,"txt":"In my work, if I find somebody who's extremely successful"},{"t":57.4,"txt":"and who doesn't feel like an impostor,"},{"t":60.5,"txt":"that makes my antenna kind of tingle."},{"t":63.4,"txt":"My spider sense is on edge because I"},{"t":66,"txt":"think I might have something that in my profession"},{"t":68.1,"txt":"we call a dark triad."},{"t":69.8,"txt":"Dark triads, in business or in personal life, or people"},{"t":72.3,"txt":"who are above average in three characteristics-- narcissism,"},{"t":76.2,"txt":"it's all about me; Machiavellianism,"},{"t":78.8,"txt":"I'm willing to do what it takes, including"},{"t":80.5,"txt":"hurting you to get my way; and psychopathy, to be psychopathic,"},{"t":84.8,"txt":"which is to say, I'm going to hurt you and feel no remorse."},{"t":87.2,"txt":"You might think that that's super rare."},{"t":88.9,"txt":"It's not."},{"t":89.6,"txt":"One in 14 people in the population"},{"t":91.8,"txt":"is above average on those three characteristics."},{"t":94.4,"txt":"Dark triads are 7% of the population."},{"t":97.4,"txt":"You know them."},{"t":98.7,"txt":"They've broken your heart."},{"t":100,"txt":"They've been disloyal to you."},{"t":101.3,"txt":"They've taken credit for your work."},{"t":102.9,"txt":"They've made life miserable, and you try to avoid them."},{"t":106.9,"txt":"Here's the truth."},{"t":107.9,"txt":"If you're doing really well in your career"},{"t":109.7,"txt":"and you're being rewarded for it,"},{"t":111.2,"txt":"and you're a good, normal, healthy person,"},{"t":114.8,"txt":"you're going to sort of wonder, is this earned?"},{"t":119.2,"txt":"Do I really deserve it?"},{"t":121,"txt":"Am I up to this task?"},{"t":123.2,"txt":"What you're doing here, as a healthy person,"},{"t":125.1,"txt":"is that you know what you're good at,"},{"t":126.5,"txt":"and you know what you're not good at."},{"t":127.7,"txt":"Well, guess what the world sees?"},{"t":128.9,"txt":"What you're good at."},{"t":129.7,"txt":"That's why you're getting ahead."},{"t":131.1,"txt":"What do they not see?"},{"t":132,"txt":"The things that only you see, which"},{"t":133.5,"txt":"is what you're trying to get better at."},{"t":135.2,"txt":"You have full visibility."},{"t":136.9,"txt":"You're looking at the entire landscape."},{"t":138.8,"txt":"The rest of the world is not."},{"t":140.1,"txt":"They're looking at the ways that you're creating value."},{"t":142.7,"txt":"You're looking at the ways that you can't create value yet."},{"t":145.6,"txt":"And you tend to focus because of what psychologists"},{"t":148.3,"txt":"call negativity bias on what you don't have as opposed"},{"t":151.2,"txt":"to what you have."},{"t":152.3,"txt":"When you focus as a striving, hard working, ambitious,"},{"t":156.2,"txt":"and upwardly mobile person on what you don't have,"},{"t":158.4,"txt":"you're going to feel like an imposter."},{"t":160.8,"txt":"That's just the way it is, unless you're a dark triad."},{"t":165.6,"txt":"So what do you do if you have imposter syndrome?"},{"t":168.2,"txt":"The answer is to understand it, keep up to date with it,"},{"t":171.3,"txt":"and keep trying to get better at the things"},{"t":173.1,"txt":"that you're not good at yet."},{"t":174.3,"txt":"This is an opportunity."},{"t":175.2,"txt":"It's for growth, for becoming the person"},{"t":177.1,"txt":"that you truly want to be."},{"t":178.5,"txt":"Even if other people overestimate how awesome you"},{"t":181.4,"txt":"are, which of course they do, you don't have to,"},{"t":185.6,"txt":"and you can focus on the ways that you can actually"},{"t":187.7,"txt":"become better."},{"t":188.9,"txt":"If you feel imposter syndrome, that's great."},{"t":192.2,"txt":"That means all kinds of good things about you."},{"t":194.2,"txt":"But don't miss the opportunity."},{"t":195.6,"txt":"Don't miss the opportunity to focus on the ways"},{"t":197.6,"txt":"that you actually can get better and keep striving more for it."},{"t":201.3,"txt":"Lean into the imposter syndrome without giving in to it."},{"t":205.5,"txt":"Lean in without giving in."},{"t":208.7,"txt":"When you're an accomplished professional,"},{"t":210.8,"txt":"and you're upwardly mobile, and you're being successful,"},{"t":213.5,"txt":"what that means is that people are"},{"t":215,"txt":"focusing more on your strengths than your weaknesses."},{"t":217.3,"txt":"And it also says you have more manifest strengths"},{"t":220.3,"txt":"than you do weaknesses."},{"t":221.8,"txt":"Now, if things are going in the wrong direction,"},{"t":224.1,"txt":"you're getting a whole lot of bad press and you're on your way"},{"t":226.1,"txt":"down, it means people are paying more attention"},{"t":227.9,"txt":"to your weaknesses than your strengths."},{"t":229.6,"txt":"And it might be that your weaknesses are a bigger"},{"t":231.8,"txt":"deal than your strengths."},{"t":233.2,"txt":"The truth is, if things are really, really rough for you,"},{"t":235.6,"txt":"you're not all weaknesses."},{"t":236.8,"txt":"And if things are going really well for you,"},{"t":238.6,"txt":"you're not all strengths."},{"t":240.1,"txt":"Here's the problem."},{"t":241.1,"txt":"If you're a well-adjusted person with a modicum of humility,"},{"t":244.9,"txt":"you're going to feel like a loser"},{"t":246.3,"txt":"when everybody else sees you as a winner."},{"t":248.4,"txt":"But rest assured that when things are going well for you,"},{"t":251.7,"txt":"that means that people are more focused on your strengths"},{"t":254.4,"txt":"than they are on your weaknesses."},{"t":255.8,"txt":"Don't focus more on your weaknesses than your strengths,"},{"t":258.2,"txt":"but recognize them because that's"},{"t":259.5,"txt":"your opportunity for growth and change and improvement."},{"t":262.8,"txt":"[MUSIC PLAYING]"}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"ARTHUR"},{"t":0,"w":"C."},{"t":0,"w":"BROOKS:"},{"t":0,"w":"In"},{"t":0,"w":"my"},{"t":0,"w":"work,"},{"t":0,"w":"I"},{"t":0,"w":"specialize"},{"t":0,"w":"in"},{"t":0,"w":"strivers,"},{"t":0,"w":"really"},{"t":3.47,"w":"hard-working"},{"t":3.47,"w":"people,"},{"t":3.47,"w":"ambitious"},{"t":3.47,"w":"people."},{"t":5.552,"w":"These"},{"t":5.552,"w":"are"},{"t":5.552,"w":"the"},{"t":5.552,"w":"people"},{"t":5.552,"w":"who"},{"t":5.552,"w":"want"},{"t":5.552,"w":"to"},{"t":5.552,"w":"do"},{"t":5.552,"w":"a"},{"t":5.552,"w":"lot"},{"t":5.552,"w":"with"},{"t":5.552,"w":"their"},{"